        "description": "Name (default `Sequence <n>`).",
        "default": null
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "media"
    ],
    "description": "Adds a sequence holding the given assets one after another from 0: pictures and stills on\n`V1`, a video's sound linked on `A1`, audio files on `A1`. Each clip takes the whole asset,\nfloored to whole frames (a still gets 5 s). The format is the project's default.",
    "title": "SequenceCreateFromMedia"
  },
